OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin with
OL,6,Fmist or fog patches but most places
OL,7,Fdry. Any mist or fog will be slow to
OL,8,Fclear. Showery rain will push into the
OL,9,Fnorth from late morning before
OL,10,Fspreading south during the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FEvening showers will retreat
OL,13,Fto the coasts to leave inland areas
OL,14,Fdry with clear spells overnight. The
OL,15,Fnight will become frosty with a few
OL,16,Ffog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
