OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry, bright at first but
OL,6,Fblustery, locally heavy and wintry
OL,7,Fshowers spread southeast from late
OL,8,Fmorning. These showers become less
OL,9,Ffrequent from late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,12,Fwith blustery and wintry showers
OL,13,FThursday. Less cold with showery rain
OL,14,Fwest Friday becoming breezy with
OL,15,Fincreasing outbreaks of showery rain
OL,16,Fwest Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
